## Figure 5. XGBoost Feature Importance: Steps + Static Model

```{r fig4-importance, echo=FALSE, fig.height=8, fig.cap="Figure 5. Top 20 XGBoost feature importances (Gain): Steps + Static, 14-Day and 30-Day Horizons. Bars filled by feature category (colorblind-friendly Set2 palette). Gain = fractional contribution to total information gain across all trees. Labels show Gain x 100."}
# Shared label helper
feat_display_names <- c(
  k_steps_7d_avg               = "7-day avg. daily steps",
